abstract: >-
  A unified research edition of the 22 German radio cryptograms in the
  Lasry-Schmeh challenge, with source-linked recoveries, attributed earlier
  decipherments, new partial readings, explicit editorial hypotheses, and
  independently reproducible coordinate-level certificates.
